{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"DHI-awro-xm33-ecil-etld","published":"2026-11-18T23:16:47Z","modified":"2026-11-18T23:30:03.209370873Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-59861"],"summary":"Kiota is an OpenAPI based HTTP Client code generator. Prior to 1.29.1 and 1.32.0, Kiota's Ruby generator embedded…","details":"Kiota is an OpenAPI based HTTP Client code generator. Prior to 1.29.1 and 1.32.0, Kiota's Ruby generator embedded OpenAPI default fields, property names, and other schema-derived strings through CodeMethodWriter.cs and SanitizeForQuotedLiteral() in Writers/StringExtensions.cs into Ruby double-quoted literals without escaping #, allowing attacker-controlled #{expr}, #$var, or #@var interpolation markers to inject arbitrary Ruby code into generated model classes. This issue is fixed in version 1.29.1 and 1.32.0.","affected":[{"package":{"name":"apicurio-registry-ui-3.2","ecosystem":"Docker Hardened Images:Debian:13","purl":"pkg:deb/dhi/apicurio-registry-ui-3.2"},"versions":["3.2.6-0","3.2.6-1"],"database_specific":{"owner_kind":"HSP","source":"https://github.com/docker-hardened-images/advisories/blob/main/dhi/osv/2026/DHI-awro-xm33-ecil-etld.json"}},{"package":{"name":"apicurio-registry-ui-3.3","ecosystem":"Docker Hardened Images:Debian:13","purl":"pkg:deb/dhi/apicurio-registry-ui-3.3"},"versions":["3.3.4-0","3.3.4-1"],"database_specific":{"owner_kind":"HSP","source":"https://github.com/docker-hardened-images/advisories/blob/main/dhi/osv/2026/DHI-awro-xm33-ecil-etld.json"}}],"references":[{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://scout.docker.com/v/DHI-awro-xm33-ecil-etld"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-59861"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-xg2h-5xr2-29jw"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://github.com/microsoft/kiota/security/advisories/GHSA-xg2h-5xr2-29jw"},{"type":"FIX","url":"https://github.com/microsoft/kiota/pull/7746"},{"type":"FIX","url":"https://github.com/microsoft/kiota/commit/fee1b648bb4394ba7ba72de